        "method": "tag-face-adjacency-v1",
        "description": "Each valve plane is the interface between a chamber and what it opens into, so it borders exactly two of the six documented tags and that pair identifies it. Counts are shared triangles between tag groups; a neighbour carrying less than 2% of a group's chamber-facing boundary is a graze, not a border. Position is not consulted.",
